{"availability":"available","full":"lukamaul777-cyber/tourism-reit-asset-evaluator","name":"tourism-reit-asset-evaluator","description":"A Streamlit dashboard for tourism REIT asset suitability evaluation, risk warning, scenario stress testing, and automated reporting.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-24T12:31:24Z","updated":"2026-06-27T08:54:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tourism-reit-asset-evaluator-slsuamhgrgxskvdnoyns3a.streamlit.app/","topics":["asset-management","dashboard","data-visualization","digital-tourism","financial-analysis","portfolio-project","python","reits","risk-analysis","scenario-simulation","streamlit","tourism-management"],"demo":"https://tourism-reit-asset-evaluator-slsuamhgrgxskvdnoyns3a.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:32.846Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:32.846Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:32.846Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T09:07:32.846Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tourism REIT Asset Evaluator is a Streamlit-based data product for evaluating the REITs suitability and risk profile of tourism-related consumption infrastructure assets, including scenic areas, resort complexes, and hotel assets.","The project integrates regulatory-style gatekeeper checks, a reference-based 100-point scoring model, risk warning analytics, model reliability and validity checks, scenario simulation, automatic report generation, and English / Simplified Chinese UI switching. It is designed as a transparent portfolio prototype rather than a black-box rating model.","This project sits at the intersection of digital tourism management, tourism asset operation, REITs suitability analysis, and risk analytics. It demonstrates how structured data, model documentation, validation checks, and product design can support asset-management communication."],"featu